    "id": "check-pilot",
    "language": "So in this demonstration, uh, it's a two v one against a defender with, uh, two attacking players against the goal. Here, we're going to show the importance of checking. This defender is going to come towards me and guard me. I'm going to try to lure him out of the space guarding the goal, and then I'm going to show you how, through a sinc- simple pass and return, we can change the position of the player, uh, and create space to score on the goal. Okay, so un-pause, come outside. See, the defender follows me. I receive the ball here. Now that the defender is away from where he originally was, we can pass back to the, to the player who has more space to then attack forward into the open space that we created by pulling the defender away from the center line.",
